    <summary>Ultra-fast native DevSecOps, DAST workbench and HTTP proxy in Rust by el saghet.</summary>
    <description>
OpenSec Studio v1.10.10 is a high-performance offensive security and DAST assessment suite developed in native Rust and Tauri.
Featuring instantaneous 150ms boot times, low memory footprint (&lt;95MB), Nuclei YAML templates, live MITM proxy, OAST collaborator, and offline CVE databases.
    </description>
